1. Create a new pod called nginx with the image nginx:alpine. The Pod should make use of the PVC local-pvc and mount the volume at the path /var/www/html.
The PVC local-pvc should be in a bound state.
A:
$ vi pod.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: nginx
  labels:                        //
    name: myfrontend              //these two lines are for local-pvc binding and nginx pod running
spec:
  containers:
    - name: myfrontend
      image: nginx:alpine
      volumeMounts:
      - mountPath: "/var/www/html"
        name: mypd
  volumes:
    - name: mypd
      persistentVolumeClaim:
        claimName: local-pvc


connections of storage, volume, persistent volume, persistent volume claim, storage class:
volume是pod用的存储
persistent volume是cluster中的真实存储资源
PVC是用户申请存储的“请求单”
StorageClass定义如何创建PV

两种模式：
静态绑定：admins create PV, users create PVC, system binds them               //甚至用外部存储时比如AWS EBS还要先provision storage在上面
动态绑定：users create PVC, StorageClass auto creates PV (or auto-provision storage on AWS EBS), PVC binds PV        //StorageClass决定PV如何创建

备考：
Pod 用 Volume  
Volume 连 PVC  
PVC 找 PV  
PV 由 StorageClass 创建
